quired.</li>\n<li>More Details Read the Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 84px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 84px; width: 99.9335%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"755\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Bihar CET B.Ed Common Entrance Test 2026 :&nbsp; <span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">Exam District Details</span> </span><br>\n</b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ara, Bhagalpur, Chapra, Darbhanga, Gaya, Hajipur, Medhepura, Munger, Muzaffarpur, Patna &amp; Purnea</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 450px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 450px; width: 99.9335%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"755\"><center><br>\n<!-- 300 x 250 mar 23 --><br>\n<br>\n</center><p></p>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Bihar B.Ed CET 2026 Admission : <span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">Participating Universities with College List</span></span><br>\n</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Aryabhatt Knowledge University, Patna</li>\n<li>Babasaheb Bimrao Ambedkar Bihar University, Muzaffarpur</li>\n<li>Bhupendra Narayan Mandal University, Madhepura</li>\n<li>Jai Prakash University, Chapra</li>\n<li>Kameshwar Singh Darbhanga Sanskrit University, Darbhanga</li>\n<li>Lalit Narayan Mithila University, Darbhanga</li>\n<li>Magadh University, Bodh Gaya</li>\n<li>Maulana Mazharul Haque Arabic and Persian University, Patna</li>\n<li>Munger University, Munger</li>\n<li>Patliputra University, Patna</li>\n<li>Patna University, Patna</li>\n<li>Purnea University, Purnea</li>\n<li>Tilka Manjhi Bhagalpur Unviersity, Bhagalpur</li>\n<li>Veer Kunwar Singh University, Ara</li>\n<li>All Universities of Bihar Running B.Ed Courses)</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 302px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 302px; width: 99.9335%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"755\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">How to Fill Bihar B.Ed &amp; Shiksha Shastri Programme Online Form 2026</span></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Babasaheb Bhimrao Ambedkar Un